00:10:00.771 --> 00:10:03.930
Police officer
involved homicides.

00:10:04.090 --> 00:10:08.810
So our main question was to
understand the what type of

00:10:08.811 --> 00:10:10.715
informations were out there

00:10:10.716 --> 00:10:13.460
