these information were.

00:10:13.461 --> 00:10:17.675
We divided our collaboration
in a few groups.

00:10:17.676 --> 00:10:21.095
I was reading
the data mining to group.

00:10:21.096 --> 00:10:22.565
We did some simple,

00:10:22.566 --> 00:10:23.840
not maybe that simple,

00:10:23.841 --> 00:10:25.595
it depends on your
skills I guess,

00:10:25.596 --> 00:10:30.940
querying of different
datasets because we had,

00:10:30.941 --> 00:10:33.940
for example, one dataset
from the FBI,

00:10:33.941 --> 00:10:35.200
that was released from FBI,

00:10:35.201 --> 00:10:37.525
one dataset collected
